From 5e7e7b4e3813a79c9b24b6eea9c62962707728c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Majid Arasskhani <M.Arasskhani@gosilkroad.net>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:22:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/22] fix(uploads): ClamAV and archive-bomb checks for chat
 attachments, voice notes and project media; extraction off the loop
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bug: only Knowledge documents were scanned. Chat attachments, voice
recordings and project media went from read_upload_bounded straight into
object storage and, for documents, into pypdf/openpyxl/python-docx running
inline on the event loop. A crafted .docx with a 1:5000 compression ratio
or a slow PDF stalled the worker for everyone; malware was stored and served
back to other members.

Change:
- app/core/archive_safety.validate_ooxml_archive is the one implementation
  of the OOXML checks (traversal, symlinks, encryption, macros, external
  relationships, entry count, expanded size, ratio; .xlsm added).
  knowledge_file_service delegates to it and keeps its UnsafeDocumentError.
- app/services/upload_screening.screen_upload(raw, filename) runs the
  archive check first (a bomb never reaches the scanner) then
  malware_scan_service.scan_bytes, fail-closed per CLAMAV_REQUIRED:
  infected -> 422, scanner down and required -> 503.
- Called from POST /api/chat/attachments/process, POST /api/chat/voice and
  POST /api/projects/{id}/media before anything is persisted.
- extract_document_text_bounded runs the parser in a thread under
  ATTACHMENT_EXTRACT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS (30) and returns a placeholder on
  timeout; the request handlers use processed_attachment_payload_async.

Tests: tests/test_upload_screening.py — ratio/traversal/macro/mismatch
refusals, infected -> 422, scanner down -> 503, bomb refused before the
scanner is awaited, loop keeps ticking during a slow extraction and the
timeout placeholder is returned. Media API tests stub the scanner.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UTnpHajSmkk2JMLfuQoV7o
